DATA SOURCES AND TILE SERVICES
- OpenStreetMap / OpenStreetMap contributors
  Data: © OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open Database License
  (ODbL) 1.0. Tiles served by the OpenStreetMap Foundation are subject to the
  OSMF Tile Usage Policy.
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
  https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/

- Servicio Geológico Colombiano (SGC)
  Public seismic data and official event products. Attribution to SGC and a
  link to the original event are shown in the application. Use is subject to
  SGC's published terms and to Colombian public-information rules.
  https://www.sgc.gov.co/

- U.S. Geological Survey (USGS)
  Earthquake data from the USGS FDSN/GeoJSON feeds. U.S. Government works are
  generally in the public domain; attribution is provided as a courtesy.
  https://earthquake.usgs.gov/

- OpenTopoMap
  Map tiles based on OpenStreetMap data and SRTM, licensed under CC-BY-SA.
  https://opentopomap.org/about

- Esri / ArcGIS Online
  World Imagery and World Dark Gray Canvas basemaps. Use is subject to the Esri
  terms of use and attribution requirements.
  https://www.esri.com/en-us/legal/terms/full-master-agreement

- ipapi.co
  Optional IP-based approximate geolocation fallback. Use is subject to the
  ipapi.co terms and privacy policy.
  https://ipapi.co/terms/

